    <entry>
      <title>Hello World</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/02/hello-world/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/02/hello-world/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Welcome to <a href="https://hexo.io/">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href="https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues">GitHub</a>.</p><h2 id="Quick-Start"><a href="#Quick-Start" class="headerlink" title="Quick Start"></a>Quick Start</h2><h3 id="Create-a-new-post"><a href="#Create-a-new-post" class="headerlink" title="Create a new post"></a>Create a new post</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo new <span class="string">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html">Writing</a></p><h3 id="Run-server"><a href="#Run-server" class="headerlink" title="Run server"></a>Run server</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/server.html">Server</a></p><h3 id="Generate-static-files"><a href="#Generate-static-files" class="headerlink" title="Generate static files"></a>Generate static files</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html">Generating</a></p><h3 id="Deploy-to-remote-sites"><a href="#Deploy-to-remote-sites" class="headerlink" title="Deploy to remote sites"></a>Deploy to remote sites</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html">Deployment</a></p>]]></content>
      
      
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>Hexo搭建教程</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/01/hexo/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/01/hexo/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>搭建hexo博客（<a href="https://langyuf.github.io/%EF%BC%89">https://langyuf.github.io/）</a><br>1、git的安装</p><figure class="highlight elixir"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">windows中<span class="symbol">:PowerShell</span> 输入 git -v 显示 <span class="title class_">Git</span> 版本</span><br><span class="line">官网下载地址<span class="symbol">:https</span><span class="symbol">://git-scm</span>.com/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>2、node.js安装</p><figure class="highlight crmsh"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">https://www.nodejs.com.cn/download.html</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">node</span> <span class="title">-v</span> 查看版本信息(尽量下载最新版本)</span><br><span class="line">配置环境</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>3、在git bash中</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">1、$ cnpm install hexo-cli -g 安装hexo</span><br><span class="line">hexo -version 查看版本信息</span><br><span class="line">2、hexo init myblog 初始化(myblog必须为空)</span><br><span class="line">_config.yml 存放的是博客配置信息， <span class="built_in">source</span>/_posts 是存放文章的地方。</span><br><span class="line">若失败可尝试换源、配置ssh证书</span><br><span class="line">3、进入myblog文件夹</span><br><span class="line">hexo clean <span class="comment"># 清除缓存文件，建议写完文章后执行一次</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g <span class="comment"># 生成 public 文件夹，写完文章执行</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo s <span class="comment"># 启动 hexo 服务</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>4、<a href="http://localhost:4000/">http://localhost:4000/</a> 访问hexo</p><blockquote><p>更换主题<br>1、下载主题文件放置myblog&#x2F;themes&#x2F;下<br>2、添加_config.主题名.yml文件<br>3、修改_config.yml中themes</p></blockquote><p>部署在github上</p><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">1</span>、创建一个新仓库，仓库名必须是用户名 + <span class="selector-class">.github</span>.io然后勾选初始化README</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">2</span>、创建一个git秘钥，ssh-keygen -t rsa -C “wangqh202208@<span class="number">163</span>.com“ password:<span class="number">6230961</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">3</span>、cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa<span class="selector-class">.pub</span> 输出密钥信息</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">4</span>、在github中创建shh key 输入密钥</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">5</span>、git bash中输入:ssh -T git@github<span class="selector-class">.com</span> yes</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">6</span>、在创建的仓库中 <span class="selector-tag">code</span> 中复制ssh中的dizhi</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">7</span>、在_config.yml文件中修改</span><br><span class="line">deploy:</span><br><span class="line">type: git</span><br><span class="line">repo: git@github<span class="selector-class">.com</span>:langyuf/langyuf<span class="selector-class">.github</span><span class="selector-class">.io</span><span class="selector-class">.git</span></span><br><span class="line">branch: master</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">8</span>、执行命令</span><br><span class="line">$ git config –global user<span class="selector-class">.name</span> “yourname”</span><br><span class="line">$ git config –global user<span class="selector-class">.email</span> “youremail”</span><br><span class="line">cnpm install hexo-deployer-git –save</span><br><span class="line">hexo <span class="selector-tag">g</span> -d</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">9</span>、在github仓库中的settings的pages中更改branch为master</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">hexo <span class="selector-tag">g</span> -d</span><br><span class="line">hexo s</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>创建文件夹<br>hexo new page categories</p><p>网站图标<br>favicon: &#x2F;img&#x2F;favicon.png</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
